==========================================================================
Interpretation
==========================================================================
tightness ~= 1.0  -> interval encoding [lo,hi] is EXACT; O(1) storage suffices
tightness << 1.0  -> interval wait pulls in false parents; needs mask/adjacency
high degree + tightness 1.0 -> the case E1 says must be measured SEPARATELY from
                               structural complexity, because the two are
                               conflated in BlockMaestro's n-group injection.

